&quot;Your help is always appreciated Paul. If this doesn&#39;t go to plan I may need you to keep people clear of any debris.&quot;&nbsp;

With a few quick finger taps on his suits internal sensor array to do a sharp sudden exposure of Absolute Zero&#39;s forearms to allow for rapid fire suppression.&nbsp;

